<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Next Section</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://stackpath.bootstrapcdn.com/bootstrap/4.3.1/css/bootstrap.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/confidence.css">
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            color: #333;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
        }
        .header-section {
            padding: 2rem 0;
            background-color: white;
            border-bottom: 3px solid #4285f4;
        }
        .instruction-card {
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            background-color: white;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .instruction-card-header {
            background-color: #4285f4;
            color: white;
            padding: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .instruction-step {
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
        }
        .instruction-step:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .proceed-btn {
            background-color: #4285f4;
            border: none;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(66,133,244,0.3);
            padding: 0.6rem 2rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .proceed-btn:hover {
            background-color: #3367d6;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 12px rgba(66,133,244,0.4);
        }
        .congrats-text {
            color: #4285f4;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .emphasis {
            font-weight: 500;
            color: #333;
        }
        .source-text, .size-text {
            color: #4285f4;
            text-decoration: underline;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .alert-instruction {
            font-style: italic;
            color: #555;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header-section">
        <div class="container">
            <h1 class="text-center">Next Section</h1>
            <p class="text-center congrats-text">Congratulations on completing the practice questions!</p>
            <p class="text-center alert-instruction">Please pay close attention to the following instructions:</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container my-4">
        <div class="row justify-content-center">
            <div class="col-lg-10">
                <div class="instruction-card">
                    <div class="instruction-card-header">
                        What's Next in This Activity
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="instruction-step">
                        <p class="mb-0">In the next part of the activity, you will be asked to complete a series of question blocks, each consisting of twenty questions.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="instruction-step">
                        <p class="mb-0">Each time, you will be presented with two options for the automated assistance you will receive. These choices will be labeled by their <span class="source-text">source</span> and <span class="size-text">size</span>.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="instruction-step">
                        <p class="mb-0">One of the options utilizes recommendations generated by either a medium or large <em>group of humans</em>. The other option utilizes recommendations generated using <em>machine learning</em>, with either medium or large amount of training data.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="instruction-step">
                        <p class="mb-0">You will choose one of these options to assist you in the following round, and that decision will be permanent for the next twenty image identification questions. Use the provided assistance as needed to ensure your accuracy.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="text-center mt-5">
                    <p>Click the button below to proceed to the main portion of the activity.</p>
                    <form action="/activity/{{ userID }}/buffer/next" method="post">
                        <button type="submit" class="btn proceed-btn">Proceed to Next Section</button>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
